# An options card answered in the chat as the Android app shows it (Decisions.kt DecisionUnder): the option tapped, the
# options and 忽略 go (fading, to 90%, their room closing on the rows' spring a little late) and 你 选择了「…」 comes in
# their place; then another card let go with 忽略 (280 ms, ArchiveEase, its room closing). The motion log has both.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 发消息
type 选一个颜色 {T} card:按钮用什么颜色 {T}|橙色 {T}*|灰色 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
timeout 120000
until =灰色 {T}
wait 1500
shot 1-card
tap =橙色 {T}
until 选择了「橙色 {T}」
gone =灰色 {T}
shot 2-answered
tap 发消息
type 再选一个 {T} card:先做哪一页 {T}|首页 {T}|设置页 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
gone 正在发送
until =设置页 {T}
wait 1500
tap =忽略
gone =忽略
gone =设置页 {T}
shot 3-dismissed
